        <mxCell id="tier_app" value="application Tier | 10.82.48.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• VPC Interface Endpoints: execute-api, cognito-idp&#10;• Security Group CL-APP-01: Inbound TCP 443 from cc-staff, cc-logistics, cc-ground-stations [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-APP-02: Endpoint policy restricted to platform API ARNs [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=10;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
