        <mxCell id="tier_storage" value="object_storage Tier | 10.82.80.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• VPC Interface Endpoint: Amazon S3 (com.amazonaws.us-east-1.s3)&#10;• Security Group CL-DRN-01: Inbound TCP 443 from cc-ground-stations only [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-DRN-02: Policy: s3:PutObject &amp;amp; AbortMultipart on drone bucket [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=10;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
